   "body": "/claim cloud/i797-opus\n\nPlan:\n- Tests first (`tooling/fixtures/tests/test_anonymize.py`), one per shape, seen red: forged boundary inside the signature's `td.messCase2`, no boundary after a signature, non-elements while `after_personal`, an HFR `</span>` followed by something other than end tags / blanks / `<br>`, and the three uncovered conditions of #794 (CDATA XML exemption, footer-table attribute restriction, bare `br`).\n- Fix `anonymize.py` so each uncovered shape raises (redactor) or is reported (`check`), keeping the check independent of the redactor (LESSONS 33-34).\n- Corpus `check`, `manifest_check.py`, tooling tests green and old vs new `anonymize` byte-identical on the corpus; draft PR on `chore/797-anonymizer-followups`, Fable adversarial review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
